    "A LTO linear_impl.1 retains fixed E_INTERNAL/detail0x07000004 after successful load; B linear_impl is181 lines retaining explicit missing-pair error and pair writeback. A binary-vector metadata is dropped, whereas B returns perturbed second source and binding fields correctly.",
